how's it going everybody it's warren  welcome back to the cosmic wonder where  we talk all things marvel and  mcu and today we're going to be talking  about black panther to wakanda forever a  movie that has been  up to this point kept under wraps pretty  well it's been a pretty big mystery so  far  although some things do come out that  give us a little bit of information  about the movie we've had a few cast  members talk about what they've seen and  heard so far  and each of them so far have said that  the movie is  going to work and it's going to pay  tribute to chadwick bozeman in a very  nice way  and that's sort of what we have today  actor martin freeman who plays  everett ross in the marvel cinematic  universe was on a talk show recently and  he talked about  going over the script with ryan coogler  and he described it as  odd and this is the first time that  we've really heard anything besides  really positive words about the script  for black panther to wakanda forever but  this is going to be  probably the hardest film to make  because of the loss of chadwick boseman  especially since they decided to not  recast him so we'll go over what martin  freeman had to say  about the script and about his zoom call  with ryan coogler the director and  writer of black panther 2. also remind  her about my stormbreaker giveaway it  ends at the end of this month all you  have to do to enter subscribe to my  channel and cosmic culture  link in the description down below so  martin freeman who plays everett ross  appeared on the late  late show with james corden and he  teased a little bit of what's to come as  far as his role is concerned and the  entire plot for wakanda forever  while on the show james corden asked him  about the film in which he revealed that  a couple of months ago he had a zoom  call with ryan coogler where they talked  about the script  and this is what he had to say about  that i had a zoom call with ryan  coogler the director and co-writer about  seven or eight weeks ago  i suppose he sort of meticulously took  me through  all of my character's beats in the film  he took me through the film but  incorporating my character's beats and  some of it was  really very odd and i think that ryan  coogler could see from the reaction on  my face to some of the things he was  saying  my face must have had a very shocked  expression on it  because he kept sort of stopping and he  kept going  saying stay with me but this is going to  work  people are in for i think a real treat i  mean we've not done it yet  who knows we might make it awful but i'm  hoping we won't i'm hoping people are  going to be in  for a treat freeman ended the  conversation about this by stating  obviously the hope is we do the first  film justice and we do chadwick's legacy  on it justice and make  hopefully another good film so this is  very interesting but it's also  pretty good keep in mind that martin  freeman could have just thought that  his character's role was pretty odd not  the entire script as it is  other cast members have already  commented on the script stating that it  does a really  really good job at honoring chadwick's  legacy and ryan coogler seems to have  a very good vision of what he wants the  film to be  and he apparently thinks that it's going  to work really really well  on screen he even said to martin freeman  people are in for  a real treat which is great because i  think some people are actually really  worried about the film  especially since they're not going to  read cast t'challa  but cast members like lupita nyong'o who  plays nakia  in black panther stated that the film is  going to do chadwick justice  and the script is very good now so far  we don't really know much about the  actual plot we do have our actor that is  going to be playing the main villain  tanakh  huerta however the villain is  unspecified at this point we don't know  who the villain is actually going to be  however i do have a theory on who he  could be playing  tina cuerta is a mexican actor and  the atlantean race according to  traditional theosophy  includes those of the mongolian race the  malayan race and the american  indian race and since tina cuerta is of  mexican descent he could play  one of these races which means that he  could be playing  namor neymour could be the villain of  black panther 2. wakanda  and atlantis have a pretty big history  together specifically they  are at war with each other in fact in  the avengers vs x-men comic line namor  practically destroys wakanda with the  help of the phoenix force  and another part to kind of add to this  is also the fact that there's casting  calls for  warriors and that's all they really say  about this casting call  now the wakandan warriors we pretty much  already have  they'll pretty much use the same people  from the first black panther film  avengers infinity war and avengers  in-game so the casting call for new  warriors most likely  isn't for wakandan warriors and since  the casting call for  these warriors came out the same time  that it was announced that tenna kuerta  was going to be the main villain  it would make sense that these casting  calls would be for something related to  the main villain as well  so these warriors could be atlantean  warriors  so before the unfortunate passing of  chadwick boseman there were a lot of  reports going around that  black panther 2 was going to introduce  atlantis and neymar in the film  if these reports were true then  originally before the passing of  chadwick there was going to be a battle  between  t'challa and neymar and it was said that  we were really going to explore  atlantis and it did really seem and kind  of does still really seem like marvel  was heading in the direction of  introducing namor and atlantis we've  actually had several easter eggs in the  mcu  pointing towards namor the first one we  saw in iron man 2.  when nick fury is talking to tony stark  about the avengers initiative there are  some screens in the background  these screens are apparently showing  other potential recruits  for the avengers initiative and areas  that shield is monitoring  i don't think i want you looking at that  i'm not sure it pertains to you anymore  if we take a look at one of the screens  in the background we can see  africa and on the screen there is one  circle in the middle of  africa that is wakanda and the second  circle is a little bit to the left in  the middle of the atlantic ocean  that's atlantis there's really nothing  else that could be except for atlantis  and neymar and this is  all the way back in iron man 2 which  means they have kind of been planning  this for a long time now and then of  course we have  the really big name or easter egg which  is confirmed to be  a neymar easter egg by the writers in  avengers end game  in the beginning of avengers in-game  when natasha is talking to  rocket okoye captain marvel and nebula  okoye mentions that there was an  earthquake in the atlantean ocean  and okoye says that the best way to deal  with it is by  not dealing with it now the earthquake  is caused by the atlanteans and again  atlantis and wakanda are usually at war  with another so okoye doesn't really  want anybody to know  about atlantis or the atlantean so she  says we don't deal with it  now when one of the writers christopher  marcus was asked  if this was indeed a name or easter egg  he said  sometimes you plant seeds sometimes they  grow  basically confirming yes we are planting  the seeds for  namor and this would make perfect sense  if they were originally planning on  introducing  atlantis and namor in black panther 2.  and tina cuerta who has been cast as the  main villain still  could be playing namor unfortunately  right now it is not confirmed who  exactly the villain is going to be but i  think it would be really  really cool if it was indeed namor but  let me know what you think do you think  that neymar  is going to be the main villain of  wakanda forever and are you worried  about wakanda forever script  be sure to hit me with your thoughts in  the comments down below don't forget to  subscribe so you can stay up to date on  all things relating to wakanda forever  and of course the mcu in general  don't forget to like the video and for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter as always thank  you all so much for watching  woof  you

